      "instance_name": "political_meme",
      "label": "Political Meme",
      "description": "The image is a political meme designed to spread misinformation and incite division. It uses a false claim and a misleading interpretation of an event to discredit a political figure. This type of meme relies on emotional manipulation and false equivalence to achieve its harmful intent.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
