      "description": "The meme falsely attributes a derogatory statement to Donald Trump and uses the 2016 election outcome as 'proof' of its truth, creating a misleading and inflammatory narrative that dehumanizes voters and incites division.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_c178f2cf"
